          "description": "A blood sucker can drain the blood from a target within 30 feet. The target must make a Fortitude save (DC 12) or take 1d8 points of shadow damage and the squid is healed for that much. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 1st level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 17).",
