        },
        {
          "name": "Ink Cloud",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "A blood sucker can emit a 10-foot-radius cloud of ink once per minute as a free action while underwater. This cloud provides total concealment. The ink persists for 1 minute.",
          "notes": {
